{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-1","title":"1 Timothy 4:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 He foretells that in the latter times there shall be a departure from the faith. 6 And to the end that Timothy might not fail in doing his duty, he furnishes him with divers precepts, belonging thereto.</p>\n<p>the Spirit. Joh 16:13; Ac 13:2; 28:25; 1Co 12:11; 1Jo 2:18; Re 2:7,11,17,29 Re 3:6,13,22 expressly. Eze 1:3 the latter. Nu 24:14; De 4:30; 32:29; Isa 2:2; Jer 48:47; 49:39; Eze 38:16 Da 10:14; Ho 3:5; Mic 4:1; 2Ti 3:1-9; 1Pe 1:20; 2Pe 3:3; Jude 1:4,18 depart. Da 11:35; Mt 24:5-12; 2Th 2:3; 2Ti 3:1-5; 4:4 seducing. Ge 3:3-5,13; 1Ki 22:22,23; 2Ch 18:19-22; 2Co 11:3,13-15 2Th 2:9-12; 2Ti 3:13; 2Pe 2:1; Re 9:2-11; 13:14; 16:14; 18:2,23 Re 19:20; 20:2,3,8,10 and doctrines. Da 11:35-38; 1Co 8:5,6; 10:20; Col 2:18; Ac 17:18; Re 9:20; *Gr:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-2","title":"1 Timothy 4:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>lies. 1Ki 13:18; 22:22; Isa 9:15; Jer 5:21; 23:14,32; Da 8:23-25; Mt 7:15 Mt 24:24; Ac 20:30; Ro 16:18; Eph 4:14; 2Ti 3:5; 2Pe 2:1-3; Re 16:14 their. Ro 1:28; Eph 4:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-3","title":"1 Timothy 4:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Forbidding. Da 11:37; 1Co 7:28,36-39; Heb 13:4 to abstain. Ro 14:3,17; 1Co 8:8; Col 2:20-23; Heb 13:9 which. Ge 1:29,30; 9:3; Ec 5:18; Ac 10:13-15; 1Co 6:13 with. 4; 1Sa 9:13; Mt 14:19; 15:36; Lu 24:30; Joh 6:23; Ac 27:35; Ro 14:6 1Co 10:30,31; Col 3:17 believe. 2:4; Joh 8:31,32; 2Th 2:13,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-4","title":"1 Timothy 4:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>every. Ge 1:31; De 32:4 and. Ac 11:7-9; 15:20,21,29; 21:25; Ro 14:14,20; 1Co 10:23,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-5","title":"1 Timothy 4:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>it. 3; Lu 11:41; 1Co 7:14; Tit 1:15 the. Lu 4:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-6","title":"1 Timothy 4:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>thou put. Ac 20:31,35; Ro 15:15; 1Co 4:17; 2Ti 1:6; 2:14; 2Pe 1:12-15; 3:1,2 Jude 1:5 a good. Mt 13:52; 1Co 4:1,2; 2Co 3:6; 6:4; Eph 6:21; Col 4:7; 1Th 3:2 2Ti 2:15 nourished. Jer 15:16; Eph 4:15,16; Col 2:19; 3:16; 2Ti 3:14-17; 1Pe 2:2 good doctrine. 1:10; 4:16; 6:3; Ps 19:7; *marg: Pr 4:2; Joh 7:16,17; 2Ti 4:3; Tit 2:1,7-10; 2Jo 1:9 thou hast. Php 3:16; 2Ti 3:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-7","title":"1 Timothy 4:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>refuse. 1:4; 6:20; 2Ti 2:16,23; 4:4; Tit 1:14; 3:9 exercise. 1:4; 2:10; 3:16; 6:11; Ac 24:16; 2Ti 3:12; Tit 2:12; Heb 5:14 2Pe 1:5-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-8","title":"1 Timothy 4:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>bodily. 1Sa 15:22; Ps 50:7-15; Isa 1:11-16; 58:3-5; Jer 6:20; Am 5:21-24 1Co 8:8; Col 2:21-23; Heb 13:9 little. or, for a little time. Heb 9:9,10 godliness. 6:6; Job 22:2; Tit 3:8 having. De 28:1-14; Job 5:19-26; Ps 37:3,4,16-19,29; 84:11; 91:10-16 Ps 112:1-3; 128:1-6; 145:19; Pr 3:16-18; Ec 8:12; Isa 3:10; 32:17,18 Isa 33:16; 65:13,14; Mt 5:3-12; 6:33; 19:29; Mr 10:19,20; Lu 12:31 Lu 12:32; Ro 8:28; 1Co 3:22; 2Pe 1:3,4; 1Jo 2:25; Re 3:12,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-9","title":"1 Timothy 4:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-10","title":"1 Timothy 4:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>therefore. 1Co 4:9-13; 2Co 4:8-10; 6:3-10; 11:23-27; 2Ti 2:9,10; 3:10-12 Heb 11:26; 13:13; 1Pe 4:14,15 because. 6:17; Ps 37:40; 52:8; 84:12; 118:8; Isa 12:2; 50:10; Jer 17:7; Da 3:28 Na 1:7; Mt 27:43; Ro 15:12,13; 1Pe 1:21 the living. 3:15 the saviour. 2:4,6; Ps 36:6; 107:2,6-43; Isa 45:21,22; Joh 1:29; 3:15-17 1Jo 2:2; 4:14 specially. Joh 5:24; 1Jo 5:10-13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-11","title":"1 Timothy 4:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>6:2; 2Ti 4:2; Tit 2:15; 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-12","title":"1 Timothy 4:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>no. Mt 18:10; 1Co 16:10,11; 2Ti 2:7,15,22 be thou. 1Co 11:1; 1Th 1:6; 2:10; 2Th 3:7-9; Tit 2:7; 1Pe 5:3 in word. 2Co 6:4-17; Php 4:8; 2Ti 2:22; Jas 3:13,17; 2Pe 1:5-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-13","title":"1 Timothy 4:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>I come. 3:14,15 to reading. De 17:19; Jos 1:8; Ps 1:2,3; 119:97-104; Pr 2:4,5; Mt 13:51,52 Joh 5:39; Ac 6:4; 17:11; 2Ti 2:15-17 to exhortation. Ro 12:8; 1Co 14:3; Tit 2:15 to doctrine. 6,16; 1Co 14:6,26; 2Ti 4:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-14","title":"1 Timothy 4:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Neglect. Mt 25:14-30; Lu 19:12-26; Ro 12:6-8; 1Th 5:19; 2Ti 1:6; 1Pe 4:9-11 which. 1:18 with. 5:22; Ac 6:6; 8:17; 13:3; 19:6; 2Ti 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-15","title":"1 Timothy 4:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Meditate. Jos 1:8; Ps 1:2; 19:14; 49:3; 63:6; 77:12; 104:34; 105:5; 119:15,23,48 Ps 119:97,99,148; 143:5 give. Ac 6:4; 1Co 16:15; 2Co 4:14; 8:5; Tit 2:14 that. 6; Mt 5:16; Php 2:15,16 to all. or, in all things.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-1ti-4-16","title":"1 Timothy 4:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"1TI","chapterStart":4,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":4,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Take. 1Ch 28:10; 2Ch 19:6; Mr 13:9; Lu 21:34; Ac 20:28; 1Co 3:10,11 Col 4:17; 2Ti 4:2; Tit 2:7,15; Heb 12:15; 2Jo 1:8 unto the. 6; 1:3; Ro 16:17; Eph 4:14; Tit 2:7; Heb 13:9; 2Jo 1:9 continue. Ac 6:4; 26:22; Ro 2:7; 2Ti 3:14; Tit 1:9 thou shalt. Eze 3:19-21; 33:7-9; Ac 20:26,27; 1Co 9:27 them. Isa 55:11; Jer 23:22; Ro 10:10-14; 11:14; 1Co 9:22; 1Th 2:16,19,20 2Ti 2:10; Phm 1:19; Jas 5:20</p>"}]}